8.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いい名前が出てきません"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/uncategorized/2011/12/21/8030.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"どんなフェレットなんですか？w"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/uncategorized/2011/12/21/8274.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"何て呼べばいいですか？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/uncategorized/2011/12/21/8258.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私、ニックネームとかまだないんで、まあや！って呼んでくださいっ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/uncategorized/2011/12/21/8119.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Sorry"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/uncategorized/2011/12/21/8274.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"広島と東京はどっちが寒い？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/uncategorized/2011/12/21/8258.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"広島の方が寒いと思いますぅ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/uncategorized/2011/12/21/8119.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/uncategorized/2011/12/21/8274.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph